<h2>Your <%= @tier_label %> trial is ending soon</h2>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Your StudioFlow <strong><%= @tier_label %></strong> trial ends in
  <strong><%= @days_left %> day<%= @days_left == 1 ? '' : 's' %></strong>.
</p>

<p>
  To keep enjoying all the features you've been using — unlimited clients,
  analytics, payout tracking, and more — please add a payment method before your
  trial expires.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @billing_url %>">Manage your subscription →</a>
</p>

<p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email — we're happy to help.</p>

<p>
  Thanks,<br>
  The StudioFlow Team
</p>
